  "description": "A cheerful Christmas seamless pattern bundle featuring a variety of cute festive themes and holiday characters. The collection includes playful Christmas cats, dachshunds, snowy winter village scenes, girly Christmas characters, western-inspired holiday designs, pastel preppy Christmas elements, festive farm animals, Santa, reindeer, snowmen, gingerbread characters, Christmas trees, cozy kitchen scenes, ornaments, gifts, bows, candy canes, and more. Each pattern uses a charming hand-drawn style with bright seasonal colors and coordinating backgrounds, making this bundle perfect for fabric, wrapping paper, scrapbook projects, stationery, gift packaging, seasonal crafts, home decor, and festive digital designs.\n❤️ You will receive\n✅ 8 PNG files\n✅ 12 x 12 inches\n✅ High resolution 300 DPI\n✅ Seamless Pattern\n❌ Not editable",
